      "description": {
        "es": "Convierte los movimientos de tipo Normal en tipo Hielo y aumenta ligeramente su potencia.",
        "en": "Turns the bearer's Normal-type moves into Ice-type moves.  Moves changed by this ability have 1.3× their power."
